        "id": "mqtt-help",
        "type": "markdown",
        "title": "MQTT → Tier-2 → Stream",
        "width": "full",
        "text": "ESP32 publish JSON tới topic city/sensors/{sensor_id}/data qua mosquitto:1883. iot-bridge forward sang POST /v1/capabilities/telemetry/ingest {datasetId: city-iot-readings, readings, source:'mqtt'}; Tier-2 ghi Base + publish Tier-1 Stream. Cống nước → dùng JSN-SR04T chống nước + rain + phao tràn."
